NvwEF7LoL&_nc_oc=Adovaktoql-eqFz2fHW3fzquNDXvsH1Ax-MmvwctCsF0qVN_lG_1pVKzKtVCZZ8ewwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKozRXrP_hob4r_5LfHhTZREKbCRIAxbsQVm973rQv7ww&oe=6ABD3608"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "3D Stunt Bike Extreme Rush VR Ride", "keywords": ["3DBikeStuntVR", "VRBikeRacing", "MotorcycleVRRide", "ExtremeBikeStunts", "VRBikeRacingGame"], "long_description": "Get ready for the ultimate thrill ride in 3D Stunt Bike Extreme Rush VR Ride! Experience heart-pounding action and jaw-dropping stunts in the most immersive VR bike stunt game ever. Race through intense, high-speed tracks, and perform extreme stunts that will test your skills and reflexes.\nWith stunning 3D graphics and realistic VR immersion, feel like you\u2019re truly in the driver\u2019s seat of a stunt bike, pushing the limits of speed and control. From daring jumps and flips to dangerous obstacle courses, every track offers a new challenge to master. The rush of wind, the thrill of speed, and the excitement of defying gravity are all here in virtual reality.\nFeatures:\nExtreme Stunt Bike Challenges: Take on various challenges, from high-speed races to complex stunt courses.\n3D VR Racing: Immerse yourself in a 3D world filled with fast-paced action and breathtaking visuals.\nJaw-Dropping Stunts: Perform flips, jumps, and gravity-defying tricks in VR.\nMultiple Tracks: Race through a variety of environments, each more challenging than the last.\nAdrenaline-Fueled Action: Feel the thrill with every stunt and every second of the race.\n3D Stunt Bike Extreme Rush VR Ride is not just a game \u2013 it\u2019s an experience. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned stunt rider or a newcomer to VR, this game will push your limits and give you a rush like no other. Are you ready to ride, stunt, and race in the most extreme VR experience available?", "short_description": "Ride in 3D Stunt Bike Extreme Rush VR! Master crazy stunts, race on challenging tracks, and feel the adrenaline rush in stunning VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/3dstunt-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Horizon Hub", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhubcom/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25755910020705118"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1075818548273600"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1661785418646177"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2456242974803210"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1322958872665339"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1887906815979392"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1623365978968334"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1332631042005732"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1416929520138727"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "719926491185768"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1574841780378192"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25336655529309694"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "25336655529309694"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1075818548273600"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25